          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "EE9E03F44274D84E",
      "text": "Come dice?! Io?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "9127BAF43F83EF74",
      "text": "Beh, altrimenti dovrò fare da solo.\\nInvece così siamo tutti più tranquilli, no?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "EE9A76F44271B2E0",
      "text": "Questo senz’altro, ma dubito di essere\\nla persona più adatta...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "EE9A77F44271B493",
      "text": "Ah, perdonami! Non fraintendermi.\\nNon è che non abbia voglia di farlo.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "EE9A78F44271B646",
      "text": "È solo che il Preside Bluebert cerca sempre\\ndi rifilare ad altri qualche sua incombenza...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "EE9A79F44271B7F9",
      "text": "Non ci siamo per niente![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "9127BDF43F83F48D",
      "text": "Come sei severa, Rupi.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0040_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "EE9A7AF44271B9AC",
      "text": "Mh, questa però sarebbe anche un’occasione per\\nconoscere [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0909)]il famosola famosa [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
